OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn was emailed over ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak before he denied knowing about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Secretary Stephen Flynn told
OL,7,Fa Holyrood committee he knew nothing
OL,8,Fabout a highly flammable gas leak on
OL,9,Fboard a CalMac ferry, despite records
OL,10,Fshowing he had been emailed about the
OL,11,Fincident.
OL,13,FA faulty valve led to 700kg of methane
OL,14,Fgas being vented from the side of MV
OL,15,FGlen Sannox while it was carrying
OL,16,Fpassengers from Arran to Troon last
OL,17,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
