OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn was emailed over ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak before he denied knowing about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlynn claimed he missed a BBC Scotland
OL,7,Freport on the incident as he was
OL,8,Ffacetiming his children before he
OL,9,Fappeared in front of the Scottish
OL,10,FParliament's transport committee last
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FBut a briefing document released via a
OL,14,Ffreedom of information (FOI) request
OL,15,Fshowed Flynn was contacted about the
OL,16,Fstory twice in the hours after it was
OL,17,Fpublished.
